oris-trace 1
# Every branch of tree_realloc, in order: shrink in place (split; the remainder
# coalesces with any free neighbour), grow into a free next block, grow backwards into
# a free previous block (the pointer moves), and the alloc-copy-free fallback. Then a
# bucket realloc that stays in its slot, one that moves to a bigger bucket, and one
# that leaves the bucket path for the tree.
alloc h0 2000
alloc h1 2000
alloc h2 2000
realloc h1 1000
realloc h1 1500
free h0
realloc h1 3000
realloc h1 20000
alloc h3 20
realloc h3 24
realloc h3 100
realloc h3 1000
realloc h3 50
free h1
free h2
free h3
purge
